# 仓库统一使用 LF，避免 Windows 协作者 checkout 时把脚本 / SVG 换成 CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf

# PDF.js 随附的字符映射与字体数据是二进制，禁止任何换行或编码转换
*.bcmap binary
*.pfb   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.db    binary
